{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-人群定向、DMP 与 RTA\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"使用发布接口可以将人群包进行发布，适用于创建数据源、更新数据源、推送人群包、拓展或运算人群包等场景。可通过【人群包详细信息】接口查询人群包状态。每个人群包每24小时只可发布一次。\",\"id\":\"dmp.custom_audience.publish\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/dmp/custom_audience/publish/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"1696710571768844\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"dmp.custom_audience.get_detail\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710571259916\",\"reason\":\"可通过此接口查询人群包的状态\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"人群包详细信息\"},{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"发布人群包接口需要授权access-token，通过此接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix_return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"发布人群包接口的应答参数中返回码和返回信息的说明参考此接口文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"1696710571768844\",\"title\":\"发布人群包\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-A9RpGeeh\">使用发布接口可以将人群包进行发布。</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-DThFA6m9\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OYehnkEW\">发布人群包接口简单的说是一个让人群包在平台生效的操作，存在以下4种场景将用到发布人群包接口：<br/>1.在创建数据源，人群包ID首次生成后，必须先使用发布人群包接口将人群包发布，才可使用；<br/>2.如果更新了数据源，需要使用发布人群包接口才能把数据源的最新的内容发布（更新）到人群包中，发布人群包后数据源的最新内容将在人群包中生效，否则更新内容将无法生效；<br/>3.如果是推送人群包，推送之后同样需要调用发布人群包接口才可将人群包生效;<br/>4.如果是拓展人群包或者运算人群包，人群包ID生成后同样也需要调用发布人群包接口才可将人群包生效；人群包发布是一个异步的过程，将有一段处理的时间，你可以通过<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710571259916\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">【人群包详细信息】</a>查询人群包的状态，其中返回参数<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">delivery_status</code>表征当前人群包可投放状态（包含是否发布完成）；发布频次限制：每个人群包每24小时只可发布一次，发布后需在24小时后才可以再次发布此人群包。</p></blockquote><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-TUCJPwOw%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-IqfAB66A%5C%22%3E%E6%AF%8F%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%BA%E7%BE%A4%E5%8C%85%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E8%AE%A9%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-KHTPuRoN%5C%22%3E%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%8D%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E5%AF%B9%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%BA%90%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E4%BC%9A%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E7%BE%A4%E5%8C%85%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E6%8E%A8%E8%BF%9F%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vdaiB%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-TUCJPwOw%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-IqfAB66A%5C%22%3E%E6%AF%8F%E5%BD%93%E4%BA%BA%E7%BE%A4%E5%8C%85%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E8%AE%A9%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-KHTPuRoN%5C%22%3E%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%8D%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E5%AF%B9%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%BA%90%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E4%BC%9A%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E4%BA%BA%E7%BE%A4%E5%8C%85%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B%E6%8E%A8%E8%BF%9F%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-TUCJPwOw\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-IqfAB66A\">每当人群包的内容发生变化，就需要再次发布让变化生效！</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-KHTPuRoN\">发布是一个异步的过程，发布中不建议对数据源进行更新操作，这会导致人群包的发布过程推迟！</li></ul></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-sRQatYj7\"><br/></p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201772464816616519%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-EQUR7ziH\" id=\"h6f20189-EQUR7ziH\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-XwLcHEU6\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/dmp/custom_audience/publish/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/dmp/custom_audience/publish/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710571768844\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-KzlpCJL4\" id=\"h6f20189-KzlpCJL4\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-bzTkZUp1\">POST</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-nugAGgF0\" id=\"h6f20189-nugAGgF0\">请求Header</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-ooD1106c\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-df3TLCAA\"><col data-id=\"cf26ce69-KbiEllQn\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.37129840546697%\"/><col data-id=\"c2c56826-R37kgjMQ\" span=\"1\" width=\"22.095671981776764%\"/><col data-id=\"c0580a68-e3H2IfCU\" span=\"1\" width=\"44.533029612756266%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-fQ04KKR5\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-NMxn3xWV\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-7X4GLaQW\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-x2THlHlb\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-CYOWWCLs\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1ZKQkpCe\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-FBjVNIV6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GXCNtPsN\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-l2wxnBi9\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-nC12bs